# WinBridge SSH public key placeholder.
#
# The Mac's PUBLIC key is injected here by tools/build_bundle.py:
#   python tools/build_bundle.py --ssh-public-key-file ~/.ssh/winbridge.pub
#
# Never put a private key, a password, or the WinBridge auth key in this file.
# One public key per line, OpenSSH format, for example:
# ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIExampleOnlyNotARealKey example@mac
